WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,699
The spring breeze does not enter the ordinary month

2
00:00:02,699 --> 00:00:05,397
Broken cold and endless years

3
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:08,096
Once coincides with the escape color

4
00:00:08,096 --> 00:00:11,180
From now on, there will be spring in this world

5
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:11,607
Ayu

6
00:00:11,607 --> 00:00:16,090
I once thought that my whole life would be broken into pieces without a spring, and I would be blamed for the coldness and loneliness.

7
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:18,224
Until I met you somewhere

8
00:00:18,224 --> 00:00:19,932
I have just stepped through a cold cave

9
00:00:19,932 --> 00:00:22,280
Bumped into my own flower blossom

10
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:26,706
Pei Ziqian, Pei Ziqian

11
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:31,133
You are really worse than a beast

12
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:36,192
She is the prince’s wife

13
00:00:36,192 --> 00:00:43,780
You actually used alcohol to go crazy and tease her!

14
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:48,150
As long as the prince knows about it, he won't have to chop off my hands holding silver needles!
